NAME
  ViennaPSPluginModule
DESCRIPTION
  A ParaView plugin for ViennaPS semiconductor process simulation.
  Provides geometry creation and process simulation capabilities.
REQUIRES_MODULES
  VTK::CommonCore
  VTK::CommonDataModel
  VTK::CommonExecutionModel
  VTK::FiltersCore
  VTK::IOCore
  ParaView::pqComponents